    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that... but it feels different this time. it's not just a bad mood. it's like looking at a forest fire from the middle of it. you can't stop it, you can't fix it, you just stand there and wait to get burned. what's the point of being \"hopeful\" when the actual reality is just... destruction? it feels so futile.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
